{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:67aaa53d3e12790b","name":"Lando Calrissian, Dashing Scoundrel","source":{"id":"source:reference-67aaa53d3e12790b","title":"Lando Calrissian, Dashing Scoundrel","revision":21659,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:14:05Z","sha256":"1e598d0bf42b8c70545da3abd9ea6979dce6b45d1d1a29f4d82054a4b07d33ec","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21659","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lando%20Calrissian%2C%20Dashing%20Scoundrel&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-67aaa53d3e12790b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Wing Guard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Wing_Guard","referenceId":"reference:d74477954346a060"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["It's all in the cards.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A few years before the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin"},", Lando Calrissian won ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Millennium Falcon"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Millennium_Falcon","referenceId":"reference:9905dc607fa551e9"}," in a game of sabacc on Cloud City when a gambler couldn't cover his debt. Not too long after, again in Cloud City, Lando lost The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Falcon"]}," to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Han Solo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Han_Solo","referenceId":"reference:a89025e6f64f390b"}," when he used a marker good for any ship on his second-hand ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," lot (not knowing that Han was aware that The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Falcon"]}," was parked there at the time).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Years later, after fighting in the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nar Shaddaa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nar_Shaddaa","referenceId":"reference:69680e00e40913c9"}," and the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taanab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taanab?action=edit&redlink=1"},", Lando found himself a game of sabacc against the Baron-Administrator of Cloud City, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dominic Raynor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dominic_Raynor?action=edit&redlink=1"},". The pot was enormous. Lando bet 4 million credits (loaned to him secretly by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lobot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lobot","referenceId":"reference:a308bb2275c858c7"},", using pooled funds from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ugnaughts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ugnaughts?action=edit&redlink=1"}," who desperately wished to get rid of Raynor) and his used ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," lot against Raynor's post as Baron-Administrator, and Lando won.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The gambler, smuggler, and occasional mercenary suddenly found himself in a respectable position of authority, looking after the well-being of the inhabitants of Cloud City while pulling down a good income from the Tibanna gas mines. Everything was finally working out after years of struggle, years of gaining and losing fortunes, and Lando felt as if he could relax and enjoy the fruits of his labor.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["And that's when Vader showed up.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Lando Calrissian, Dashing Scoundrel Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://sw